    "Four official shared front/side/rear photos and the manual diagrams were inspected, but no complete Nikon Z-specific set or identified Z rear was available; electronic contacts remain null.",
    "The Chinese/global 70 x 90.9 mm and approximately 496 g specifications are not mount-resolved. Japan explicitly assigns 68 x 82 mm/492 g to Leica L and says dimensions and weight vary by mount; existing Z values are retained pending mount-specific confirmation, not replaced by L values. Accessory measurement conditions remain unitemized.",
